  "sourceTitle": "Moroccan Seasoning Salt & Spice Rub",
  "sourceText": "Moroccan Seasoning Salt & Spice Rub\nBy: Chris Paulk\nPublished: Thursday, December 23, 2010 - 9:41am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 1/2 cups coarse kosher salt\n1 tablespoon paprika\n2 teaspoons cumin\n1 teaspoon cinnamon\n1/8 teaspoon ground star anise\n1/8 teaspoon ground cardamom pods\n1/4 teaspoon cayenne pepper\n1/4 teaspoon ground ginger\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix all ingredients together in a large bowl. 2 Store in an airtight container.\n\nAbout\n\n\nThis salt rub makes a nice last minute gift and a super simple blended spice rub for meats or poultry. sprinkle a pinch in with your veggies for a nice exotic flavor boost.",
